# Wave W17-P (Route 116): echo sand — tunnel-hill sand: a pale, slightly grey-cool sand, the road quieting as it climbs to the bore’s mouth (design-authorised: a clear connected path of pale sand running end to end, Copperton to the Copperbore doors). Split from Route 117’s warm flower-road sand by the cool cast: this sand is hill shade, not field sun.
